ecision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o086","basis":"景耀六年冬"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o086a-q","zhuge-q-o086","zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o086a-q","source_order":[35,410,"O086a"],"order":6827}],"persons":[{"id":"guanzhang-p0011","name":"张遵","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"guanzhang-p0012","name":"诸葛瞻","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"huangli-p0018","name":"李球","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"huangli-p0036","name":"黄崇","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0080","name":"邓艾","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0029","name":"邓忠","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wgc-p0033","name":"师纂","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"duzhou-q-ebb0099964c927cd1134","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8a67d616dc335860e00f","layer":"original","quote":"景耀六年冬，魏大将（军）邓艾克江由，长驱而前。而蜀本谓敌不便至〖3〗，不作城守调度；及闻艾已入（阴）平〖4〗，百姓扰扰，皆进山野，不可禁制","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":297,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69},{"id":"huangli-q-008c50ce62f462a5ce4d","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-06a51967d1668bb5b546","layer":"original","quote":"瞻盘桓未进〖1〗，崇屡劝瞻“宜速行据险，无令敌得入平（地）”。瞻犹豫未纳，崇至于流涕","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":26,"end":68},{"id":"huangli-q-01c5afceb9b0607b4686","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-417ead1270fb5c2f3823","layer":"original","quote":"会艾长驱而前，瞻却战至绵竹","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"huangli-q-3a910cb638d63807dce2","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-06a51967d1668bb5b546","layer":"original","quote":"随卫将军诸葛瞻拒邓艾，到涪县","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":52,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":25},{"id":"huangli-q-88668c4110c7053cccf0","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-417ead1270fb5c2f3823","layer":"original","quote":"崇帅厉军士，期于必死，临阵见杀","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":53,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":29},{"id":"huangli-q-88a275deef402a0641ef","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-0dc5c04328f7048c3197","layer":"original","quote":"随诸葛瞻拒邓艾，临阵授命，死于绵竹","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":19,"end":36},{"id":"wgc-q0049","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"蜀卫将军诸葛瞻自涪还绵竹〖18〗，列陈待艾。艾遣子惠唐亭侯忠等出其右〖19〗，司马师纂等出其左。忠、纂战不利，并退还，曰：“贼未可击。”艾怒曰：“存亡之分，在此一举；何不可之有！”乃叱忠、纂等，将斩之。忠、纂驰还更战，大破之；斩瞻及尚书张遵等首，进军到雒〖20〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":132},{"id":"wgc-q0077","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻。维等闻瞻已破，率其众东入于巴〖3〗。会乃进军至涪，遣胡烈、田续、庞会等追维〖4〗。艾进军向成都；刘禅诣艾降，遣使敕维等令降于会。维至广汉郪县〖5〗，令兵悉放器仗，送节、传于胡烈〖6〗，便从东道诣会降。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":114},{"id":"wgc-q0382","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"蜀卫将军诸葛瞻自涪还绵竹〖18〗，列陈待艾","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wgc-q0384","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-f79d34065989623ef2a7","layer":"original","quote":"艾怒曰：“存亡之分，在此一举；何不可之有！”乃叱忠、纂等，将斩之。忠、纂驰还更战，大破之；斩瞻及尚书张遵等首，进军到雒","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":325,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":68,"end":127},{"id":"wgc-q0470","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a20ce9841d0949b327ba","layer":"original","quote":"艾遂至绵竹，大战，斩诸葛瞻","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":531,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":13},{"id":"zhuge-e-o086a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖18〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-5c4c42970dd122437e5b","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"zhuge-q-o086","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
